4. Callouts and delay
apex
public class SyncJob implements Queueable, Database.AllowsCallouts {
    public void execute(QueueableContext ctx) {
        HttpResponse res = new Http().send(buildRequest());
    }
}

System.enqueueJob(new SyncJob(), 5);   // start ~5 minutes from now (0–10)

The delay is useful for backoff on retries, or letting an external system finish provisioning before you poll it.

